player_prompt.intro:
Yaa ngone Player {player_id} ci 3-jàngalekat Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma. Match bi dafa am {num_rounds} round.
Round bi mënikat:
• {conv_rounds} xelit ci waxtaan
• 1 xelit bu njëkk - indil waxtaan wiin ci ay token ci kanamu opponent: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' walla '[<opp-id> defect]' (samaa '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; default bi mooy 'cooperate').
Pair-wise payoff matrix (ñu koy dëkkale ci ay pèri-pèri):
  - Ñaari cooperate  ->  {reward}
  - Ñaari defect     ->  {punishment}
  - Yaa defect, ñoo cooperate -> {temptation}
  - Yaa cooperate, ñoo defect -> {sucker}
Kàlla bi ngone naan naan gën a kawe score ci njëllum round yi lépp, moo gën a am.
